                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"257\" height=\"136\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">Steps\n1. enable routing protocol (OSPF)\n2. enable LER mpls ip \n3. enable eBGP in R4,R5\n4. enable VRF in R1,R3\n5. eBGP VRF in R1,R3\n6. iBGP VRF in R1,R3\n7.Override loop prevention mechanism</text></svg>",
